<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let’s get the living and abiding, operating word</l><l>more into our hearts!</l><l>Into our hearts! Into our hearts!</l><l>Let’s get the living and abiding, operating word</l><l>more into our hearts!</l><l>Into our hearts today!</l><l>Let’s read the Bible! Take in the pure milk!</l><l>And by it we will grow—oh, taste and see,</l><l>oh, taste and see!</l><l>God’s Word, the Bible! God’s Word, the pure milk!</l><l>Yes, by it we will grow—oh, taste and see!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
